# Backend Environment Variables (VPS + Cloudflare Tunnel)

## Main API (cmd/api)

```bash
# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://rexio:***@localhost:5432/rexiocity
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=change_me_please
JWT_EXPIRY=15m
REFRESH_SECRET=change_me_please
REFRESH_EXPIRY=720h

# Domains
FRONTEND_URL=https://city.rexio.pro
ADMIN_URL=https://oppscity.rexio.pro
BACKEND_URL=https://connect2city.spritexai.dpdns.org

# Media (Cloudflare R2)
MEDIA_ENDPOINT=https://cdn-city.rexio.pro
MEDIA_BUCKET=rexio-city
MEDIA_ACCESS_KEY=***
MEDIA_SECRET_KEY=***
MEDIA_URL=https://cdn-city.rexio.pro

# Server
PORT=10800
```

## Admin API (cmd/admin)

```bash
# Database (separate admin project)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://rexio:***@localhost:5432/rexiocity_admin
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Auth
JWT_SECRET=change_me_please_admin
JWT_EXPIRY=15m
REFRESH_SECRET=change_me_please_admin
REFRESH_EXPIRY=720h

# Main API URL (for cross-service calls)
MAIN_API_URL=https://connect2city.spritexai.dpdns.org

# Server
PORT=10900
```

## Email (Brevo)

```bash
BREVO_API_KEY=***
BREVO_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@rexio.pro.bd
```
